    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6233" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Calentum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Call-</span></b> ), i, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in</i> Hispania Baetica, now
